Package: treedataR
Title: Read and Write 'TreeData' Lineage Tracing Files
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("William", "Colgan", , "wcolgan@mit.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Read and write the '.h5td' (HDF5) and '.zarr' files produced by
    the Python 'treedata' package. Files are loaded as
    'TreeSummarizedExperiment' objects, with trees represented as
    'tidytree::treedata' objects that keep internal-node annotations such as
    ancestral character states.
URL: https://github.com/YosefLab/treedataR
BugReports: https://github.com/YosefLab/treedataR/issues
License: BSD_3_clause + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.5.0)
